msgid "A click chooses the game; a double click follows it on the board."
msgstr "Ein Klick wählt die Partie; ein Doppelklick verfolgt sie auf dem Brett."

msgid "A click goes to the move"
msgstr "Ein Klick springt zum Zug"

msgid "A click goes to the move it is about"
msgstr "Ein Klick springt zum betreffenden Zug"

msgid "A click goes to the move · the right button: the line it expected, on the board or as a variation, and its comment as it is"
msgstr "Ein Klick springt zum Zug · die rechte Maustaste: die erwartete Linie, auf dem Brett oder als Variante, und ihr Kommentar unverändert"

msgid "A click on a cell takes that field from that source. The merged game keeps the number of the oldest (No. {}); the other is marked deleted, and Ctrl+Z brings it back. Where each field came from is kept with the game (its MergedFrom tag); a broadcast's game keeps its source."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a game opens it on the Board page, with this dossier as its list (Ctrl+← and Ctrl+→)."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a game opens it, on a name their dossier, on a tie-break's heading changes the tie-breaks, kept for this tournament. The rating change: FIDE's formula, each player's K from FIDE's list when they are matched with it, else by FIDE's rules."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a line opens it on the Board page, the Tree tab on their games alone, from their side."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a move shows it, in a variation too; ← and → go through the moves, F turns the board over."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a square then empties it. A right click empties a square whatever is chosen."
msgstr "Ein Klick auf ein Feld leert es dann. Ein Rechtsklick leert ein Feld, egal was gewählt ist."

msgid "A click on a square: a white pawn, a black pawn, nothing."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on the curve goes to the move. The dots are the key moments: dark for a good move, orange for a mistake."
msgstr "Ein Klick auf die Kurve springt zum Zug. Die Punkte sind die Schlüsselmomente: dunkel für einen guten Zug, orange für einen Fehler."

msgid "A click opens it on the Board; your move is played there."
msgstr "Ein Klick öffnet sie auf dem Brett; dein Zug wird dort gespielt."

msgid "A click opens one, the right button on a changed one discards its changes; Ctrl+Tab from any page of a view whose Board is for study"
msgstr "Ein Klick öffnet eine, die rechte Maustaste auf einer geänderten verwirft ihre Änderungen; Strg+Tab von jeder Seite einer Ansicht, deren Brett fürs Studium ist"

msgid "A click opens their dossier."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click plays an endgame; then ↑ ↓ choose another and Enter plays it."
msgstr "Ein Klick spielt ein Endspiel; danach wählen ↑ ↓ ein anderes, und Enter spielt es."

msgid "A click plays it on the Board page"
msgstr ""

