msgstr "Ein Turnier braucht die Kerne: Die Herausforderungen werden währenddessen mit „später“ abgelehnt."

msgid "A tournament waits to start."
msgstr "Ein Turnier wartet auf seinen Start."

msgid "A tournament: the games of one event, its site and year. Its system is guessed (a round robin when each played each, Swiss otherwise); a click on it changes it. A click on a tournament, or Enter, opens its crosstable; Esc goes back."
